elete, and amplify.</p><p>It works in Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, and Copilot.</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48132227.566582/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuc21hcnRicmV2aXR5LmNvbS9zaW1wbGlmeS1wcm9tcHRzP3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1zaW1wbGlmeS1wcm9tcHQtcGFjayZ1dG1fc291cmNlPWF4aW9zLW1hcmtldHMmdXRtX21lZGl1bT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyLWFkJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PXByb21wdHBhY2stYm9vayZzdHJlYW09YnVzaW5lc3M/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCe4b3fed3\" target=\"_blank\">Get all 16 prompts</a></strong></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 20px 3.5% 10px 3.5%; margin: 0; line-height: 1.75; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5; font-size: 16px; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px; font-family: Georgia, serif;\">\r\n<p><strong>Thanks for reading! </strong>Send us your thoughts, questions and suggestions for coverage<strong> </strong>or just say hello at <a href=\"mailto:emily.peck@axios.com\" target=\"_blank\">emily.peck@axios.com</a> and <a href=\"mailto:matt.phillips@axios.com\" target=\"_blank\">matt.phillips@axios.com</a> or reply to this email.</p><p><em>Thanks to Jeffrey Cane for editing and Carlin Becker for copy editing this edition.</em></p><p><em>Tell your friends <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48132227.566582/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3NpZ251cC9idXNpbmVzcy1zdWl0ZT91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc21hcmtldHMmc3RyZWFtPWJ1c2luZXNz/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB84551a0b\" target=\"_blank\">to sign up here</a>. </em></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"l\" style=\"padding:24px 4%;margin:0;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><table width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:0 auto;width:100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"font-size:0\"><img src=https://static.axios.com/img-email/axios-pro-deals.png style=\"width:100%;max-width:87px;min-width:6